When building these experiences, people will refer to the "service" ([/src/service](mdc:src/service)) and "client" ([/src/client](mdc:src/client)).

Folders to code in:

- [/src/service](mdc:src/service): Devvit blocks entry — event triggers (CommentCreate, PostCreate), settings, PolicyEngine. Runs via `devvit.json` `blocks.entry`.
- [/src/client](mdc:src/client): React webview (inline + main entrypoints). Call `fetch('/api/...')` to reach [/src/server](mdc:src/server).
- [/src/server](mdc:src/server): Express serverless backend. Redis, Reddit API, `/api/*` routes, `/internal/*` menu/trigger handlers.
- [/src/shared](mdc:src/shared): Types shared between client and server.

Rules:

- Assume that typescript, vite, tailwind, eslint, prettier, and all codebase configuration is working. If there is a bug, it is more likely your code than the codebase configuration.
- Prefer type aliases over interfaces when writing typescript
